Feature: bira context

  Scenario: Context shows project summary after init
    When I run "sh -c 'bira init --name ctx-proj > /dev/null && bira context'"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "ctx-proj"
    And output contains "Open tasks:"

  Scenario: Context --json returns structured output
    When I run "sh -c 'bira init --name ctx-json > /dev/null && bira context --json'"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "\"project_name\": \"ctx-json\""
    And output contains "\"open_task_count\":"

  Scenario: Context --full shows feature breakdown
    When I run "sh -c 'bira init --name ctx-full > /dev/null && bira context --full'"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "ctx-full"
    And output contains "backlog"
    And output contains "Ready:"

  Scenario: Context --full --json shows features array
    When I run "sh -c 'bira init --name ctx-full-json > /dev/null && bira context --full --json'"
    Then exit code is 0
    And output contains "\"features\":"
    And output contains "\"is_backlog\": true"
